{"title":"Ben Kornell","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Ben Kornell was named the successor to <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Richard_Rusczyk\" title=\"Richard Rusczyk\">Richard Rusczyk</a> as CEO of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> on March 24th, 2025. \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ben_Kornell&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Richard_Rusczyk\" title=\"Richard Rusczyk\">Richard Rusczyk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:ADMIN\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:ADMIN\">A:ADMIN</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Ben_Kornell&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<div class=\"noprint\" style=\"white-space: nowrap; float: right;\"></div>\n<table class=\"messagebox standard-talk\" id=\"wikipedianarticle\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><i>The subject of this article, <b>Ben Kornell</b>, has edited the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki\" title=\"AoPS Wiki\">AoPS Wiki</a> as <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Benkornell&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Benkornell (page does not exist)\">benkornell</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User_talk:Benkornell&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User talk:Benkornell (page does not exist)\">talk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:Contributions/benkornell\" title=\"Special:Contributions/benkornell\">co